	(descr "YXC OW7EL89CENUNFAYLC-52M TCXO 2016. Land per YXC YSO510TP TCXO spec (LCSC C22434896, p23/merge/od/dl/lcsc/C22434896.pdf) p2 'Dimensions and Recommended Land Pattern', 2.0*1.6 mm: body 2.05 x 1.65, land 0.6 x 0.8, gaps 1.1 x / 0.4 y, pin 1 bottom-left (1 OE/NC, 2 GND, 3 OUT, 4 VDD). recommended land with the outer edges trimmed to the budget envelope (inner gaps 1.1 / 0.4 kept). DENSE: budget envelope TCXO2016 2.1 x 1.7 vs recommended 2.3 x 2.0: outer edges 1.15/1.00 -> 1.05/0.85 (0.025 past the body); lands 0.5 x 0.65 cover the 0.4 x 0.625 bottom terminals (p2 bottom view). Corrected copy of OpenDrone:OSC-SMD_4P-L2.0-W1.6-BL_TXC_7Z (same frame), F.Fab body, no component silk; spec hardware/tools/land_specs/OSC-SMD_4P-L2.0-W1.6-BL_TXC_7Z_Dense.json")
